When publicly quoting, reusing or distributing the Project or modified versions, credit “网感口播 / Wanggan Talking Head — Maoyu” in a reasonably visible location and link to https://github.com/maomyu/wanggan-talking-head . When distributing code, skills, recipes or documentation, retain this license and existing copyright and third-party license notices, and identify your changes. Do not imply endorsement by the original author or claim wholly independent authorship.
