This license does not automatically grant any commercial rights. Before using, modifying, integrating, distributing or providing the Project primarily for commercial advantage, business activity or monetary compensation, obtain explicit written authorization from Maoyu (GitHub: maomyu). This includes paid client work, commercial promotion or monetized content production; business operations or internal commercial production; sales of plugins, templates or modified versions; and inclusion in paid tools, hosted services, SaaS, paid courses or membership products.
You may request authorization for any commercial purpose. Permitted uses, scope, duration and any fees are subject to a separate written agreement. A request, attribution, download, star, fork or lack of a reply is not authorization. Modifying or repackaging the Project does not avoid this requirement. Section 3 continues to apply unless the commercial authorization explicitly provides otherwise. See COMMERCIAL.md for the request channel and required information.

5. Inputs, outputs and other rights
This license does not transfer ownership of your inputs or outputs in which you lawfully hold rights. Generated results do not as a whole become derivative software solely because the Project was used; commercial use during production remains subject to Section 4, and public releases remain subject to Section 3. Protected Project or third-party material included in an output remains subject to its own license. Sample previews do not grant rights to use any person's likeness or voice, trademarks, or other personality or brand rights.

6. Distribution and termination
Pass this license to recipients of the Project and modified versions. Do not grant rights beyond those you hold or remove attribution or commercial-authorization conditions from Project material. Your independently created, separable additions may have their own license, without altering the terms for Project material.
Rights granted by this license terminate automatically upon breach; stop unauthorized use. Reinstatement requires written confirmation from the licensor. Rights exercisable without this license under applicable law remain unaffected.

